&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are seeking a highly motivated Sales Operations &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Working Student&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to support the Isar Aerospace commercial team, including Sales, Marketing, and Communications. The working student will serve as an active contributor to sales proposal development, deals, and marketing activities and events through the development, training, and optimization of AI-powered &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;platforms, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;agents and automation solutions, both generative and agentic. This &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;position&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; is ideal for students interested in sales operations, artificial intelligence, business analytics, prompt engineering, process automation, and UI design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The working student will work closely with Sales Operations, Revenue Operations, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;ross-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;F&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;unctional &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;eams to help design AI-driven workflows that improve productivity, sales insights, forecasting, customer engagement, and operational efficiency, creating a lean ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
