&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;Performance Marketing Working Student – Talent Acquisition&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Berlin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment type:&lt;/strong&gt; Working student, 20 hours/week&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take a look at where you&#39;ll be based: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9DG64C3moeQ&quot;&gt;watch the Berlin office tour&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Team description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Talent Acquisition&#39;s Performance Marketing function helps attract the right candidates efficiently across different markets and roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue to strengthen our in-house capabilities, you&#39;ll support day-to-day campaign operations, reporting and continuous improvement. You&#39;ll work closely with teams across Talent Acquisition and Employer branding, gaining hands-on experience in how data, digital marketing and operational processes support hiring at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the day-to-day monitoring of paid recruitment marketing campaigns and flag anything that needs attention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep job listings live, accurate and correctly categorised across active boards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support weekly performance reporting across impressions, clicks, applications, cost per application and candidate pipeline contribution, and flag unusual performance or budget pacing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate creative feedback between the TA team, Employer Brand and external agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research markets, audiences and competitors to help sharpen the marketing approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help improve recurring workflows and identify opportunities to make processes more efficient and support recurring operational tasks across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently studying Marketing, Digital Marketing, Communications, Media, Business, Data Analytics or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some hands-on exposure to marketing, recruitment, creative content or communications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with spreadsheets and interpreting basic campaign metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re detail-oriented, organised and comfortable taking ownership of recurring tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interested in digital marketing, data and how processes can be improved&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp 🎉&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office at Ostbahnhof&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Be part of an inclusive and collaborative environment where different perspectives are valued&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖️ 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days, pro-rated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚵🏾‍♂️ Access health and well-being support through our Employee Assistance Programme, an Urban Sports Club subsidy, and fitness activities, including on-site gym access, yoga sessions, and team sports&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚆 Benefit from subsidised public transport with the Deutschlandticket, offering unlimited travel on local and regional transport across Germany&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🥗 Enjoy partially subsidised office lunches and weekly breakfast&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Receive additional rewards through our employee referral programme when referring talents to join our team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 38 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt;our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a ----- class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us as a (Senior) Full Stack Developer - Web (f/m/d) in Berlin&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Story&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Full Stack Developer (Web Platform)&lt;/strong&gt; to help shape and scale thinkcell’s web platform and enable multiple teams to efficiently manage and publish content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a role for someone who only wants to work within a fixed web stack or maintain existing templates. We are looking for a web engineer who enjoys solving complex technical problems, making sound architectural decisions, and building systems that remain robust and maintainable as requirements evolve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work across frontend and backend, improve the technical foundation of our web platform, and help us build scalable solutions that enable our teams to manage and publish content. Along the way, you will collaborate closely with stakeholders across design, marketing, product and engineering but with strong ownership over technical quality, long-term maintainability, and the overall direction of the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and evolve our web platform features across front-end and CMS back-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve complex technical problems in a pragmatic way, balancing speed of delivery with long-term maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive architectural improvements that make our web ecosystem more robust, scalable, and easier to work with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve our back-end functionality in PHP and Laravel for integrations, dynamic features, and internal tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend and optimize our CMS and publishing workflows to support efficient content operations without compromising technical quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve performance, Core Web Vitals, accessibility, and technical SEO foundations across the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on the evolution of our current web architecture, while also challenging existing approaches when better solutions exist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with design, marketing, product, and engineering teams to turn business requirements into well-structured technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with back-end systems written in C++, ensuring reliable and efficient data exchange across system boundaries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve developer experience, reduce complexity, and raise the overall engineering standard of the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of technical tasks and help define best practices for modern web development at think-cell&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience building and shipping production-grade web platforms, applications, or systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven ability to solve non-trivial technical problems and work confidently in complex web related codebases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong full stack engineering skills, with solid backend experience in PHP, Laravel, or similar technologies and a frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong frontend fundamentals, including HTML, CSS, JavaScript and modern approaches to building maintainable user interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good judgment when making architectural and technical trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pragmatic mindset: you know when to build for flexibility and when to keep things simple&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and confidence to work with unfamiliar technologies or domains when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong sense of ownership and responsibility for code quality, maintainability, and technical outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating across disciplines and communicating clearly with technical and non-technical stakeholders in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Statamic CMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with static site generation challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Deployment Tools such as Jenkins or similar tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Tailwind, Alpine.js, or similar frontend tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving performance-critical, SEO-relevant, or content-heavy platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Python for automation or tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating with non-web backend systems or services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As part of our team, you will embody and help shape the following principles that define us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Forward Thinking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We embrace change and challenge the status quo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We take pride in our work and learn from our mistakes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Customer First&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We prioritize delivering lasting value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Unified Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We foster collaboration, respect, and integrity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strive for Excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We set ambitious goals and pursue quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why is thinkcell the right place for you?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We empower over 1.3 million users across 35,000 companies, including top consulting firms and major global enterprises. With offices in Berlin, Munich, Denver, Boston, London, Tokyo, and Dubai, we’re a diverse team of over 220 people, committed to innovation and excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;think-cell is more than a job – it&#39;s a chance to be part of an innovative, inclusive team that values collaboration and growth. We encourage applicants from all backgrounds to apply. Together, we can shape the future of productivity software.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We can’t wait to see what you’ll bring to the team!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Staff Software Engineer to help shape and build the next generation of our network automation platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our challenge is one of scale, complexity and criticality. We operate a massive global network supporting PlayStation Network, spanning more than 40 interconnection locations and 20+ data centres worldwide. Operating infrastructure at this scale safely and efficiently requires us to move beyond specialist-driven workflows and individual automation tools toward reliable, declarative software platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will help make that transition. You will work on software that turns complex network and infrastructure operations into reliable, API-driven and increasingly self-service capabilities. This includes building control-plane services, declarative APIs and intent-based controllers that manage production infrastructure safely and consistently across our global footprint.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is a Staff-level engineering role with significant technical influence. You will combine hands-on engineering with setting technical direction: defining architectures, solving complex cross-system and distributed-systems problems, writing designs, driving alignment with senior engineers and architects, and mentoring engineers across the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Your work will directly influence how one of the world&#39;s largest gaming networks is operated and automated, while establishing engineering patterns and platforms that can be reused across multiple network domains and services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Provide technical leadership and architectural direction for network automation and infrastructure control platforms, treating the self-service network API as a product by working with users and partner teams to define outcomes, establish clear expectations for API behavior and reliability, align on team responsibilities, and ensure those commitments are met.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Use domain-driven design with network experts, software engineers and API consumers to establish shared language and bounded contexts, then turn those agreements into versioned, testable contracts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design and build APIs, services, controllers and reconciliation workflows that manage production infrastructure safely at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build on the Kubernetes API, including custom resources and control loops that continuously converge actual state toward declared intent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own the operational Kubernetes path: CRD rollout, RBAC and admission, controller health, Helm packaging, deployment drift and incident diagnosis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design distributed workflows that operate correctly under eventual consistency, at-least-once delivery, concurrent writes and partial failure, with idempotency and safe recovery as fundamental properties.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design stable APIs, schemas and data models used across team boundaries, including versioning and backwards compatibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop patterns for multi-tenant infrastructure platforms, including tenant isolation, authorization, policy enforcement and safe automation boundaries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Establish strong approaches to testing, observability and change safety for software that changes live infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Improve software delivery practices through automated CI gates, versioned artifacts, controlled promotion, and safe deployment and recovery strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead complex migrations and modernization of existing automation, services and data models, evaluating when components should be evolved, replaced or rewritten, and ensuring safe coexistence, behavioral compatibility and retirement of legacy paths.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive technical alignment across software engineering, networking, operations and architecture teams; lead decisions within your area of accountability, contribute constructively to decisions owned by others, and make technology choices based on long-term company and product value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Mentor engineers, lead technical and design reviews, and raise software engineering standards across the wider organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in a backend language such as Python, Go, Rust or Java, including asynchronous concurrency, static typing, data modelling and validation, API development, packaging and tooling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong experience building Kubernetes controllers or operators, including custom resources and reconciliation/control-loop patterns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong experience building event-driven distributed systems, particularly eventual consistency, at-least-once delivery, idempotency, optimistic concurrency and partial-failure handling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience designing and building self-service, multi-tenant platforms, including tenant isolation, policy and access control.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong API and schema design skills, including versioning and schema evolution for interfaces consumed by other teams and systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated technical leadership across team boundaries, including driving architectural designs, building agreement among senior technical stakeholders and mentoring other engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A track record of taking ambiguous, technically complex problems from architecture through to reliable production systems that manage large-scale infrastructure, such as networks, compute or cloud resources.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Networking fundamentals, particularly BGP, IP fabrics and VXLAN/EVPN/L3VPN.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of Go, sufficient to understand and contribute to adjacent services and controllers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience designing testing and observability strategies for production infrastructure automation, including systems and backends that cannot be fully reproduced in CI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with graph databases, or with source-of-truth systems that model infrastructure and its relationships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will help establish the architecture and engineering practices behind a new generation of network automation, moving from individual scripts and specialist-driven workflows toward declarative, model-driven and reliable platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Staff level, your impact is expected to extend beyond the code you personally deliver. You will help shape the APIs and designs other teams build on, develop other engineers, and establish technical patterns that can be reused across multiple network domains and services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Endor Labs is building the Application Security platform for the software development revolution. Modern software is complex and dependency-rich, making it increasingly difficult to pinpoint the risks that truly matter. Endor Labs solves this challenge by building a call graph of your entire software estate—enabling teams to clearly identify, prioritize, and fix critical risks faster.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trusted by companies that are one or one hundred years old, Endor Labs secures code whether it was written by humans or AI, and whether it&#39;s 40-year old C++ code or cutting edge Bazel Monorepos. Endor Labs was founded by serial entrepreneurs Varun Badhwar and Dimitri Stiliadis, and is backed by leading VC firms such as Dell Technology Capital, Lightspeed, and Sierra Ventures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;993&quot;&gt;Sound interesting? Let’s talk if you want to be part of the next big leap in security innovation!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Sales Development Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Sales Development Representative (SDR) at Endor Labs, you will play a pivotal role in driving our future growth by collaborating with the Marketing and Sales&amp;nbsp; teams to qualify leads and build a robust pipeline of opportunities. You thrive on engaging with prospects, identifying high-value opportunities, and managing early sales funnel activities. You are motivated by the challenge of learning about new products and are excited to contribute to the development of our demand generation and sales process, the articulation of Endor Labs&#39; value proposition, and the creation of key sales tools and assets. If you&#39;re proactive, intelligent, persistent, and a great team player, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a talented but humble team that will help you accelerate your career. This opportunity will equip you with the skills needed to excel in this role and the next. During your time on this team, you’ll grow and develop your career with strong support from team members who are committed to investing in your success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We adopt a data-driven, analytical approach to sales development and seek someone confident in both prospecting to customers and helping refine our strategy. If you&#39;re proactive, smart, persistent, and a great teammate, this is the role for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;How You’ll Drive Growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forge New Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;: Team up with Account Executives to uncover and research high-value prospects, setting the stage for impactful connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transform Leads into Wins&lt;/strong&gt;: Take charge of following up on Marketing-generated leads, qualifying them as prime sales opportunities, and seamlessly transitioning them to the right salesperson with expertly arranged meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute with Precision&lt;/strong&gt;: Bring our outbound sales playbook to life, driving strategic outreach and generating new business with enthusiasm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage &amp;amp; Excite&lt;/strong&gt;: Reach out to potential customers through dynamic cold-calling and handle inquiries sparked by Marketing efforts, making a memorable first impression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Meaningful Connections&lt;/strong&gt;: Cultivate strong relationships with prospects by asking insightful questions, uncovering their needs, and qualifying their interest for a smooth transition to the sales team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reignite Interest&lt;/strong&gt;: Reconnect with potential customers who showed interest but didn’t convert right away, nurturing these leads until they are ready to engage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Performance&lt;/strong&gt;: Work through lead lists with determination, consistently meeting or exceeding SLAs, and maintaining focused activity to support weekly reporting and performance metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate &amp;amp; Innovate&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with Marketing to share valuable feedback and insights, helping refine targeting strategies and messaging to enhance overall campaign effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;What You Bring to the Table&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Top Performer&lt;/strong&gt;: Bring a stellar track record of exceptional performance and past successes in similar roles, showcasing your ability to excel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Dynamo&lt;/strong&gt;: Utilize your outstanding verbal and written communication skills to connect with impact and drive results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Self-Starter&lt;/strong&gt;: Thrive in a fast-paced, high-growth environment with your proactive approach and ability to tackle challenges head-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driven Achiever&lt;/strong&gt;: Channel your strong motivation and determination to consistently push boundaries and achieve top performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Innovator&lt;/strong&gt;: Excel in a remote-first setting by working seamlessly with diverse teams across functions, driving collaboration and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience in sales or business development, preferably within the cybersecurity or SaaS industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with sales tools such as Salesforce, Outreach, or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Endor Labs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building at the intersection of developer productivity and security — one of the fastest-growing spaces in software. Our dev-loved platform has real ROI, strong momentum, and customers who care about doing things right.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Endor Labs, we think big, start small, and learn fast. We take ownership, move with purpose, and always start with the customer’s success. We debate with data, make the complex simple, and challenge each other with kindness and candor. We celebrate wins, learn from misses, and have fun along the way — because when our customers win, we all win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Endor Labs is an Equal Opportunity Employer.&lt;/strong&gt; We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. Even if you don&#39;t fit every requirement above, we believe in the power of diverse perspectives and experiences, so we encourage all talented individuals to apply—there&#39;s no one-size-fits-all here.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Today’s most tomorrow company.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We built the world’s most powerful battery, the 850MW Waratah Super Battery, and now we need a Risk and Insurance expert to join the team to help us continue to develop our portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are leading the energy transition towards a better, brighter tomorrow. The work we do makes a real and very tangible impact on the future of the planet and its people. We’re 200 people around the world with 40 GWh of projects moving through development across Australia, Japan, the US and Germany.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Akaysha build, own, and operate our assets, we don’t hand a project to someone else once it’s approved. The people who design a battery site are the same people who build it and run it for the next twenty years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join our Legal, Risk and Compliance team, and own our Enterprise Risk Management Framework, business resilience planning, and global insurance program. You will also be &lt;strong&gt;responsible for driving a risk-aware culture across Akaysha Energy.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and continuously improve Akaysha’s Enterprise Risk Management Framework, embedding a strong risk culture across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive business resilience planning, including incident management and business continuity programs that support operational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Akaysha’s global insurance strategy and portfolio, ensuring effective, commercially sound coverage across corporate and project activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with brokers, insurers and internal stakeholders to manage renewals, claims, policy placement and contractual risk exposures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic risk and insurance reporting, advice and training across Akaysha.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you&#39;ll make a positive impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trust across the business by providing advice that balances risk management with commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence stakeholders at all levels, translating complex risk and insurance concepts into clear and actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a proactive, risk-aware culture that strengthens decision-making and organisational resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a continuous improvement mindset, identifying opportunities to strengthen governance, processes and insurance program effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why you’ll love working here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Flexibility first: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;we&#39;re hybrid by design, averaging 60/40 office and home split, and real trust to flex that mix when life calls for it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Room to look after yourself: $1,500 a year for your wellbeing, plus $2,000 and two extra days off for your own development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Genuinely generous parental leave: because family isn’t something you fit around a job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A stake in what we build: on top of your salary and twice-yearly bonus, permanent team members also share in the value we create through our Long Term Incentive Plan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead the energy transition with us. Apply now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe diverse teams build better solutions for the planet and its people. We’re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels respected, supported, and able to do their best work, no matter their background, identity, or lived experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

