&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-redactor-tag=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;The Role…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exciting new sales opportunity for an enthusiastic and customer focused individual who has a passion for homeware and interiors to join the Soho Home retail team. There is a full-time position available in our brand new Central London location&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a team member you will be committed to providing professional service to customers and maintaining outstanding product knowledge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-redactor-tag=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Main Duties…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver exceptional, personalised service to create memorable experiences and build customer loyalty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Greet and engage customers warmly, offering attentive and professional support throughout their visit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share confident product knowledge, including materials, styles, and availability in-store and online.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suggest suitable alternatives when items are unavailable, ensuring a seamless customer journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand individual customer needs and provide tailored recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use strong service skills to drive conversions and support sales goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to daily and weekly sales targets while keeping customer satisfaction as the top priority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay aware of best- and slow-selling products to guide recommendations and improve sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain excellent knowledge of the Soho Home brand, products, and seasonal collections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle customer queries with professionalism or refer to management when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep displays well-stocked and ensure the shop floor meets cleanliness and presentation standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly and efficiently retrieve stock from back-of-house as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide feedback to managers on customer preferences and product performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a similar role within a high-end interiors or lifestyle retail store.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine passion for interiors, design, and home styling, with a confident approach to discussing colours, styles, and trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional, confident, and customer-focused, ensuring every interaction reflects the high standards of our brand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative flair and a natural ability to inspire customers with styling ideas and product recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills – honest, open, and constructive – with both customers and team member&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible and adaptable, able to respond positively to the evolving needs of the retail environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A true team player, ready to support colleagues and contribute to a positive store culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in furniture and lighting sales is highly advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Soho House offers competitive compensation packages that feature global benefits and perks. Whether you’re seeking entry-level employment or a new opportunity to expand your profession, we offer training to develop the technical and managerial skills necessary to grow your career.&lt;/p&gt;
