&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Keyfactor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our mission is to securely connect the world: humans, machines, and AI. Keyfactor is the leader in trust infrastructure for AI and machines, helping the world&#39;s largest enterprises and government agencies take control of the cryptographic identities that safeguard every digital interaction. Behind the platform is a global team of people who care deeply about the work and each other. We move fast, think big, and show up for one another every day. If you&#39;re looking for work that matters and a team that brings out your best, we hope you&#39;ll trust your future with Keyfactor!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;itle:&lt;/strong&gt; Regional&lt;/span&gt; Sales Director, DACH&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Location: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Germany&amp;nbsp;(Remote)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Mid Level - Senior&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Function:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Direct Sales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Full-time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Travel Requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; up to 50%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Computer Network &amp;amp; Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Sales Director, you will be one of three senior individual contributors responsible for the DACH region, with ownership of a defined portfolio of enterprise accounts. This is an individual contributor role and does not include people-management responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will develop and execute focused account plans, establish executive relationships, generate and convert pipeline, and build strategic opportunities capable of navigating technical evaluation, formal procurement, and complex decision-making cycles. You will engage with CISOs, CIOs, PKI and security architects, procurement leaders, partners, and other key stakeholders to connect technical requirements with operational risk and measurable business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will collaborate closely with the other DACH sales representatives and cross-functional partners across Sales Engineering, Sales Development, Marketing, Channel, and Delivery. While you will have substantial support, you will maintain direct accountability for opportunity momentum, qualification, forecast accuracy, commercial strategy, and results across your assigned accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keyfactor provides experienced sellers with meaningful autonomy in how they develop their territory. In return, we expect self-direction, disciplined execution, sound judgment, and consistent performance against a significant sales quota. Our culture is shaped by trust, customer focus, agility, respect, teamwork, and a shared commitment to delivering results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategic plans for assigned enterprise accounts, identifying whitespace, priority use cases, routes to executive access, and opportunities for partner involvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate qualified pipeline through direct prospecting, executive engagement, account-based activities, and credible partner-led sales motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and advance multi-threaded opportunities from initial engagement through discovery, technical validation, commercial negotiation, and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead value-based conversations with senior business and technical stakeholders, translating complex security challenges into clear and compelling customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish trusted relationships with CISOs, CIOs, security architects, procurement leaders, partners, and other key decision-makers and influencers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate internal specialists and external partners to create alignment, maintain momentum, and deliver an effective customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply disciplined qualification practices and maintain accurate opportunity records and reliable forecasts throughout long, multi-stakeholder sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate public and private tenders, procurement processes, and contract negotiations while protecting value and sustaining momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ask difficult qualification questions, address obstacles directly, and take ownership of account strategy and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel throughout the DACH region as needed to support customers, partners, and business development activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications, Education, and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-NA1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success selling complex enterprise software, infrastructure, or cybersecurity solutions throughout the DACH region, including substantial multi-stakeholder transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to create new business within strategic accounts rather than relying solely on existing or inbound demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong prospecting capabilities, internal drive to win, and a sense of urgency that translates into consistent action and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in both German and English, with the ability to communicate effectively with senior business and technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong storytelling and presentation skills, including the ability to make complex technical subjects understandable, relevant, and compelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead without formal authority by creating clarity, aligning specialists and partners, and influencing decisions across multiple stakeholder groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and detail-oriented approach to account planning, opportunity qualification, pipeline management, and forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial judgment and proven negotiation skills across both direct and partner-led sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual curiosity and the ability to develop credibility within a technically complex market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of PKI, certificate lifecycle management, machine identity, cryptography, or adjacent cybersecurity markets is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MEDDPICC, Solution Selling, SPIN, or a comparable enterprise sales methodology is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work remotely within Germany and travel up to 50%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Legal right to work in Germany and ability to travel freely throughout the assigned territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and customer-focused approach, with the humility, composure, and sound judgment needed to succeed in a high-accountability environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary will be commensurate with experience. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture, Career Opportunities and Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build teams that continually strive to get better than the day before. You will be challenged daily and given opportunities to grow personally and professionally. We balance autonomy and structure to create an entrepreneurial environment to spur creativity and new ideas. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are just some of the initiatives that make our culture special:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Second Fridays (a company-wide day off on the second Friday of every month minus November and December due to the Holiday schedule). Please note that this benefit is subject to change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive benefit coverage globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Paid Parental Leave is available to new parents. Structure varies based on regional/government requirements. In regions where government-paid leave doesn’t exist, like in the U.S., the company offers generous paid parental leave, along with comprehensive adoption and fertility support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive time off globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated employee-focused ambassadors via Key Contributors &amp;amp; Culture Committees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DIVERSE Commitment, a call to action for a more inclusive and diverse future in business, society, and technology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Keyfactor Alliance Program to support DEIB efforts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing resources, wellness allowance, mindfulness app free membership, Wellness Wednesdays.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Volunteer Day, company non-profit matching, and 3 volunteer days off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Talent development and Cross Functional meetings to support professional development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular All Hands meetings – followed by group gatherings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Core Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our core values are extremely important to how we run our business and what we look for in every team member:  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trust&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; is paramount.&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We deliver security software and solutions where trust and openness are of the highest importance for our customers. We are honest and a trusted partner in every aspect of business.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; are core.&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strategize, operate, and execute through a customer-centric view. We prioritize the security interests of our customers, and we act as if their data were our own.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; never stops, it only accelerates.&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The speed of change is accelerating. We are committed, through investment and focus, to stay ahead of the innovation curve.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We deliver with &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;agility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We thrive in high-paced and continually changing environments. We navigate through newly added variables, adjust accordingly, while driving towards our strategic goals.  &lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;United by &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;respect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Respect for all is what unites us. We promote diversity, inclusivity, equity, and acting with empathy and openness, both in our business and in our communities.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; make “it” happen.&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vision and goals are not individually achievable – they require teamwork. We pride ourselves in operating as a cohesive team, creating promoters and partners, and winning as one.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keyfactor is a proud equal opportunity employer including but not limited to veterans and individuals with disabilities.&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REASONABLE ACCOMMODATION: &lt;/strong&gt;Applicants with disabilities may contact a member of Keyfactor’s People team via ----- and/or telephone at 1.216.785.2990 to request and arrange for accommodations at any time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.keyfactor.com/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;Keyfactor Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Marketing Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: Chief Commercial Officer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;UK, France, Netherlands, Belgium, Germany, Austria, Spain, Finland, USA. Some travel to our offices will be required from time-to-time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You must have the right to work in one the above countries in order to be considered for the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PQShield is looking for a Product Marketing Director who can turn complex technology into stories that people understand, remember, and act on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own how PQShield&#39;s products, technology, and vision are positioned, communicated, and brought to market worldwide. You&#39;ll sit at the intersection of product, engineering, sales, customers, and the broader security market — translating breakthrough cryptography and security technology into compelling narratives for executives, engineers, partners, and buyers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is for a strategic product marketer and exceptional storyteller who can identify the market shift, understand the customer problem, and turn complex technology into differentiated positioning that creates urgency, preference and demand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since NIST published its first post-quantum cryptography (PQC) standards, which the PQShield team co-authored, organizations across semiconductors, automotive, defense, and enterprise face significant challenges in preparing for the post-quantum transition. This role will help define the market narrative around that transition, position PQShield&#39;s portfolio within it and give customers a clear reason to act.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⚒️ What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the story: Develop the narrative, positioning, messaging, and value propositions that explain what is changing in the market, why customers need to act, the problem PQShield solves, and why our approach is differentiated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn technical capability into customer value: Work with cryptographers, engineers and product leaders to understand sophisticated technology, identify what matters to the buyer and translate technical capabilities into clear business and security value without sacrificing technical credibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position the portfolio: Own positioning and messaging for our hardware IP and software portfolio, including PQPlatform, PQPerform, PQCryptoLib, and PQMicroLib. Build a clear messaging architecture that connects the portfolio while preserving the differentiated value of each offering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the customer: Develop deep insight into customer problems, buying journeys, security requirements, regulatory pressures, barriers to adoption, buying dynamics, and the forces driving post-quantum adoption. Turn those insights into sharper products, messaging, and go-to-market strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape category and market narrative: Help define how PQShield talks about post-quantum security, cryptographic agility, and the transition to quantum-safe systems — and how we differentiate our approach in a rapidly evolving market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead product launches: Create and execute compelling go-to-market strategies for new products, certifications, partnerships, and major releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip the sales team: Build compelling presentations, stories, solution briefs, case studies, battlecards, and other tools that help sales teams communicate value and win complex deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build buyer and segment-specific stories: Develop differentiated narratives for semiconductors, automotive, military and aerospace, industrial IoT, networking, and enterprise, adapting the value story for different buyers, use cases and business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own competitive storytelling: Understand the competitive landscape and turn technical and commercial differences into clear, credible differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create exceptional content: Lead the development of white papers, thought leadership, application notes, customer stories, executive content, web experiences, and other material that establishes PQShield as a category leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring customer stories to life: Find and develop the stories that demonstrate why customers are making the transition to post-quantum security and why they choose PQShield.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across the company: Partner closely with product, engineering, sales, partnerships, and leadership to ensure the market sees one clear, compelling PQShield story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯 Required Skills And Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced product marketing leader who is exceptionally strong in positioning, messaging and strategic storytelling. You can take an emerging market, complicated buyer problem or deeply technical product and find the clear narrative inside it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of marketing experience, with significant experience in product marketing, technology marketing, B2B marketing, or a closely related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven ability to develop positioning and stories that change how markets understand a product, technology, or company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills. You can take something highly technical and make it understandable, interesting, and compelling without dumbing it down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong storytelling instincts and the ability to find the human, business, and strategic narrative inside complex technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience marketing technical B2B products, ideally in cybersecurity, semiconductors, infrastructure, embedded systems, software, or another sophisticated technology market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of security and technology buyers, and the ability to communicate credibly with CISOs, CTOs, engineers, architects, product leaders, and business executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work closely with technical experts and quickly develop enough subject-matter expertise to challenge assumptions, ask good questions, and tell an accurate story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong commercial mindset: you understand that great marketing isn&#39;t just about explaining a product — it&#39;s about creating differentiation, urgency, preference, and ultimately revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching products and taking complex offerings to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing compelling sales narratives and enablement for complex, multi-stakeholder sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent strategic judgment, with the ability to determine what the market needs to hear, why it matters, and how PQShield should say it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-moving environment where you will often need to create the narrative before the market has established one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote first company. You will work from home most of the time, but will need to join us in the office for planning sessions and key meetings as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel for customer meetings and marketing events as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO and holiday package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company contributions towards 401K/pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;…and other great benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy working as part of a technology company, value the security of our daily digital lives, and love solving hard problems - then we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PQShield is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We’re passionate about talent and proud to foster an inclusive environment; all applicants will be considered regardless of their gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability, and age.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;PQShield is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We’re passionate about talent and proud to foster an inclusive environment; all applicants will be considered regardless of their gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability, and age.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Staffbase&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We inspire people to achieve great things together. Our mission is to help organizations unlock the power of inspirational communication with the first &lt;strong&gt;AI-native Employee Experience Platform&lt;/strong&gt;. Our&lt;strong&gt; industry-leading and award-winning agentic AI communications channels&lt;/strong&gt; - intranet, employee app and email solutions - create engaging experiences that connect and empower employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Chemnitz, Germany and New York City, with offices in Berlin, London, Sydney, Tokyo, Prague, and Minneapolis–St. Paul, our diverse team of 550+ employees supports 1,500+ customers—reaching over 14 million employees—in transforming their employee experience.&lt;br&gt;We are proud to be a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Unicorn&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;company—privately valued at over $1 billion—demonstrating strong growth, innovation, and lasting impact in our industry. Together, we’re shaping the future of workplace communication.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;At Staffbase, security is at the heart of everything we build. Our Product Security team helps keep our products and customer data secure while enabling engineering teams across the company. We believe the best security work happens when people bring their authentic selves and diverse perspectives to the table and we’re proud of the unique mix of talents and backgrounds in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;As an enablement team, we provide tools, guidance, and insights that allow developers to integrate security early in the development process. We see security not as a blocker but as a trusted partner that is the foundation for better products. With us, you’ll get hands-on experience with modern security practices, mentorship from experienced engineers, and the chance to make a visible impact in a global SaaS environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We work together with curiosity, humility, and a growth mindset, supporting each other, taking ownership of our contributions, and celebrating progress along the way. Here, your ideas matter, your work will shape how we build secure products, and you’ll have space to grow into new challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Take ownership of tasks that improve our security automation and strengthen our product security pipelines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Proactively explore the use of AI for vulnerability detection and remediation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Continuously learn and share knowledge about how vulnerabilities apply in our specific product context&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Support the team by enhancing our services with software engineering solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with stakeholders across the product department and gain broad exposure to how a growing SaaS company operates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain our outbound e-mail security by regularly reviewing the related metrics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain our Web Application Firewall ruleset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Kubernetes security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;CI/CD pipelines security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain our central HTML sanitization service written in TypeScript&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Practical knowledge of security topics (e.g. penetration testing, secure software development, vulnerability management, SAST, DAST)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Strong programming skills, preferably one of the following: TypeScript, JavaScript, Kotlin, Java, Go, or Python&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Practical knowledge of Unix and Kubernetes infrastructure, preferably managed via Terraform and Kustomize&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills in English (German is a plus)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/em&gt; - we offer attractive salary packages including LTIP (unit-based Long Term Incentive Plan)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility &lt;/em&gt;- we offer flexible working time models and the option of hybrid work, and support this with a yearly flex work allowance of €1560&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recharge&lt;/em&gt; - with 31 vacation days annually (incl. one floating holiday), plus pro rata fully paid Fridays off during August&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;-&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;we’re offering a company pension scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Volunteers Day&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;- you’ll get one day off per year for supporting a social project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://imgur.com/a/kIbq0q5&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DEUTSCH:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Diese Position ist in München, Deutschland angesiedelt. Die TULIP GmbH und München ist der europäische Hauptsitz von TULIP. Wir arbeiten in einem hybriden Arbeitsumfeld und sind an 3+ Tagen pro Woche im Büro.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über TULIP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://tulip.co/&quot;&gt;TULIP&lt;/a&gt; ist die Frontline-Operations-Plattform, die Herstellern hilft, ihre Produktion zu digitalisieren, zu vernetzen und kontinuierlich zu verbessern – mit KI im Kern des Produkts. TULIP wurde am MIT (Massachusetts Institute of Technology) gegründet. Das Unternehmen hat seinen Hauptsitz in Boston, mit Büros in München, Tokio, Tel Aviv, Budapest und Singapur sowie Kundenstandorte in mehr als 45 Ländern.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Im Januar 2026 schloss TULIP seine &lt;a href=&quot;https://tulip.co/press/tulip-secures-120m-series-d/&quot;&gt;$120M Series-D-Finanzierungsrunde&lt;/a&gt; mit einer Unternehmensbewertung von 1,3 Mrd. USD ab. Führende globale Hersteller setzen auf TULIP, darunter VEKA, DMG MORI, Roche, AstraZeneca, Richemont, Saint-Gobain Aerospace und Mitsubishi Electric. Wir arbeiten mit NVIDIA, PwC, McKinsey, BCG und mehr als 160 Technologiepartnern weltweit zusammen. TULIP ist Teil der Global-Innovator-Community des Weltwirtschaftsforums, und unser CEO, Dr. Natan Linder, ist Co-Vorsitzender der Advanced Manufacturing Industry Governors Community des Forums.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Chance für TULIP in der DACH-Region&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DACH ist das Herz der globalen Fertigungsindustrie. Deutschland ist die größte Industrienation Europas und die Geburtsstätte von Industrie 4.0. Die Schweiz ist ein globales Zentrum für Pharma-, Life-Science- und Präzisionsfertigung. Österreich ist ein starker Standort für Automobilbau, Maschinenbau, Metallverarbeitung und Halbleiter. Die Region beheimatet zudem zahlreiche „Hidden Champions&quot; – mittelständische Unternehmen, die in globalen Nischenmärkten führend sind. Diese Unternehmen stehen heute vor ähnlichen Herausforderungen: Fachkräftemangel, steigende Qualitäts- und Compliance-Anforderungen sowie die Notwendigkeit, bestehende Werke zu modernisieren, ohne die Produktion zu unterbrechen. TULIP gibt den Frontline-Teams dieser Unternehmen ein KI-natives Produktionssystem an die Hand, um diesen Anforderungen zu begegnen und die Time-to-Value zu beschleunigen. Lokale Kunden vertrauen unserem Produkt in regulierten und hochpräzisen Produktionsumgebungen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir suchen nun einen &lt;strong&gt;Geschäftsführer (m/w/d) der TULIP GmbH &amp;amp; Vertriebsleiter für DACH&lt;/strong&gt;. Sie verantworten das Wachstum der DACH-Region, führen das lokale Team und repräsentieren TULIP gegenüber Kunden, Partnern und Mitarbeitenden. Dabei haben Sie die Unterstützung eines globalen Unternehmens und echten Gestaltungsspielraum, wie wir in der DACH-Region gewinnen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wichtigste Erfahrungen &amp;amp; Fähigkeiten:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ Jahre Erfahrung im Aufbau und Skalieren von B2B-SaaS-Geschäften im DACH-Markt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Umfangreiche Erfahrung in der Teamführung in Scale-up- und/oder Wachstumsphasen-Umgebungen mit globalem Bezug&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Starkes Netzwerk und hohe Glaubwürdigkeit bei Einkäufern aus Fertigung und Industrie in Deutschland, Österreich und der Schweiz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nachweisliche Erfolgsbilanz beim Erreichen und Übertreffen von Umsatzzielen bei großen, komplexen Enterprise-Deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit erstklassigen GTM-Tools wie Salesforce, Outreach, ZoomInfo, LinkedIn Sales Navigator oder vergleichbaren Tools zur disziplinierten Umsetzung von Forecasting, Reporting und Pipeline-Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Herausragende Fähigkeiten im Vertrieb komplexer, hochwertiger B2B-SaaS-Lösungen in Fertigungsumgebungen sowie im Aufbau eines erfolgreichen Teams hierfür&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verhandlungssichere Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wesentliche Verantwortlichkeiten:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leitung der TULIP GmbH als Geschäftsführer/in – Prägung von Unternehmenskultur, Betriebsabläufen und der Zusammenarbeit des lokalen Teams mit globalen Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verantwortung für die Entwicklung und Umsetzung der Go-to-Market-Wachstumsstrategie für DACH, in Zusammenarbeit mit der Commercial Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erreichen der ARR-Wachstumsziele für das DACH-Geschäft über alle Branchenvertikalen hinweg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifikation, Qualifizierung und Entwicklung neuer Geschäftsmöglichkeiten mit Kunden; Aufbau starker Beziehungen zu regionalen Partnern, Vertriebskanälen und Ökosystem-Akteuren&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enge Zusammenarbeit mit Engineering, Legal, Customer Success und weiteren Teams zur Steuerung der Deal-Abwicklung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Einstellung, Einarbeitung, Schulung und Mentoring neuer Vertriebsmitarbeitender für die Region im Zuge ihres Wachstums&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kontinuierliche Verbesserung der Vertriebsprozesse zur Unterstützung der regionalen Skalierung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wichtigste Ansprechpartner/Kollaborateure:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Globale Commercial-Teams (z. B. Account Executives, Customer Success, Professional Services)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Globale Marketing-Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Geschäftsleitung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arbeiten bei TULIP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir wissen, dass selbst großartige Kandidatinnen und Kandidaten manchmal am Hochstapler-Syndrom zweifeln. Auch wenn Sie nicht jede Anforderung erfüllen, lohnt sich eine Bewerbung – Sie geben uns damit die Möglichkeit, Sie in Betracht zu ziehen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir bauen ein starkes, vielfältiges Team auf, das harte Arbeit, Familien und persönliches Wohlbefinden wertschätzt. Zu unseren Benefits gehören:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direkter Einfluss auf Produkt und Unternehmenskultur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unternehmensanteile (Equity)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attraktives Benefits-Paket, inklusive Zuschüsse für den Arbeitsweg, Weiterbildungsbudget, Team-Events und drei Tage pro Woche Mittagessen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Arbeitszeiten und unbegrenzter Urlaubsanspruch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein inklusives, hundefreundliches Büro mit vielfältigen und inspirierenden Kolleginnen und Kollegen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtuelle und Vor-Ort-Veranstaltungen sowie Happy Hours auf globaler Unternehmensebene&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir sind ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit bietet. Bei TULIP feiern wir Vielfalt. Qualifizierte Bewerberinnen und Bewerber werden unabhängig von Herkunft, Religion, Hautfarbe, Nationalität, Geschlecht, sexueller Orientierung, Alter, Familienstand, Veteranenstatus oder Behinderung berücksichtigt. Helfen Sie uns, eine inklusive Gemeinschaft aufzubauen, die die Frontline-Operationen transformiert&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ENGLISH:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role is located in Munich, Germany. TULIP GmbH is a full operating entity and Munich is TULIP’s headquarters in Europe. We are a hybrid work environment and we are in the office 3+ days/per week. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About TULIP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://tulip.co/&quot;&gt;TULIP&lt;/a&gt; is the frontline operations platform that helps manufacturers digitize, connect and continuously improve how they run production, with AI at the core of the product. TULIP was founded out of MIT. It is headquartered in Boston, has offices in Munich, Tokyo, Tel Aviv, Budapest and Singapore, and has customer sites in more than 45 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In January 2026, TULIP &lt;a href=&quot;https://tulip.co/press/tulip-secures-120m-series-d/&quot;&gt;closed its $120M Series D&lt;/a&gt; at a company valuation of $1.3B. Leading global manufacturers run on TULIP, including VEKA, DMG Mori, Roche, AstraZeneca, Richemont, Saint-Gobain Aerospace and Mitsubishi Electric. We partner with NVIDIA, PwC, McKinsey, BCG and more than 160 technology partners worldwide. TULIP is part of the World Economic Forum&#39;s Global Innovator community, and our CEO, Dr. Natan Linder, co-chairs the Forum&#39;s Advanced Manufacturing Industry Governors Community.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity in DACH for TULIP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DACH is the heart of global manufacturing. Germany is Europe&#39;s largest industrial economy and the birthplace of Industrie 4.0. Switzerland is a global centre for pharma, life sciences and precision manufacturing. Austria is a strong base in automotive, machinery, metals and semiconductors. The region is also home to many of the world&#39;s &quot;Hidden Champions&quot;, mid-sized companies that lead global niche markets. Today, these companies face similar pressures: fewer skilled workers, rising quality and compliance demands, and the need to modernize existing plants without stopping production. TULIP gives their frontline teams an AI-native production system to meet those pressures and accelerate time-to-value. Local customers trust our product in regulated and high-precision environments. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are now hiring a Managing Director (Geschäftsführer, m/w/d) of TULIP GmbH &amp;amp; Commercial Leader for DACH. You will own the DACH region&#39;s growth, lead the local team, and represent TULIP to customers, partners and employees. You will have the backing of a global company and real room to shape how we win in DACH.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Experience &amp;amp; Skills:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience leading and scaling B2B SaaS businesses in the DACH market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience leading teams in scale-up and/or growth-stage, global environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong network and credibility with manufacturing and industrial buyers in Germany, Austria, and Switzerland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of meeting and exceeding quota targets of large, complex enterprise deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using first-class GTM tools such as Salesforce, Outreach, ZoomInfo, Linkedin Sales Navigator or similar tools to execute disciplined forecasting, reporting, and pipeline management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional skills in selling complex, high-value B2B SaaS solutions into manufacturing environments and building a successful team to do the same&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native or Fluent in German and Fluent in English to full business proficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the TULIP Gmbh as its Managing Director, setting the tone for culture, operations, and how the local team works with global teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and execute the DACH go-to-market growth strategy, in partnership with Commercial Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve ARR growth objectives for the DACH business across verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, qualify, and develop new opportunities with customers; build strong relationships with regional partners, channels, and ecosystem players&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Engineering, Legal, Customer Success and other groups to drive deal execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, onboard, train, and mentor new DACH sales team members as the region grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve sales processes to support regional scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Collaborators:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Commercial Teams (e.g., AEs, Customer Success, Professional Services)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Marketing Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working At Tulip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We know even great candidates experience imposter syndrome. Even if you don’t match every requirement, applying gives you the opportunity to be considered.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building a strong, diverse team that values hard work, families, and personal well-being. Benefits of working with us include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct impact on product and culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits package including commuter benefits, learning and development stipend, team events, catered lunches 3 days a week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work schedule and unlimited vacation policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive, dog-friendly office with diverse and inspiring colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtual and in-office global company events and happy hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. At Tulip, we celebrate all. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status. Help us build an inclusive community that will transform frontline operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note that we may use AI-based tools to support parts of our hiring process. All data processing is carried out in compliance with local data protection laws, ensuring all personal candidate information is handled securely and ethically.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As an Electronics Repair &amp;amp; Testing Specialist, you will help ensure the quality, functionality, and readiness of electronic devices such as smartphones, tablets, laptops, and consoles. This role involves hands-on functional testing, quality checks, basic troubleshooting, software updates, and carrying out or supporting repairs when needed. The position reports directly to the EVS Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an on-site position at our warehouse in Hamburg.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform Functional Testing: Test electronic devices using established processes to assess their functionality, condition, and readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Troubleshooting &amp;amp; Repairs: Identify potential issues during testing and carry out basic repairs or support repair activities when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Quality Control: Assess the condition, functionality, and performance of verified and repaired devices and confirm they meet quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform Software Updates &amp;amp; Resets: Update devices, restore them to factory settings, and ensure compliance with data privacy guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document Testing &amp;amp; Repair Results: Accurately record test outcomes, repair needs and actions, device condition, and any remaining defects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Process Improvements: Support the team in improving testing, evaluation, and repair-related workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and Repair Devices: Identify hardware and software issues in smartphones, tablets, laptops, and consoles, and, if needed, carry out repairs using established procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in repairing, refurbishing, evaluating, or testing electronic devices such as smartphones, tablets, laptops, consoles, or similar equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of electronic components, repair tools, testing procedures, and troubleshooting methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with component replacement, functional testing, device diagnostics, and quality control is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with a strong focus on repair quality, testing accuracy, and device functionality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, flexible, and able to adapt to changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to learn, improve repair and testing skills, and share knowledge with colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per your workday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Plan with Vinted matching 150% of your chosen contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Supplemental Private Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Life and Disability Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a discounted gym membership plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidised Deutschlandticket for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds interesting – you may well be just who we need.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€36.600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€43.100 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Wir suchen eine:n Werkstudent:in für medizinische Dokumentation / Tumordokumentation (m/w/d), der:die uns dabei unterstützt, unsere Mission zu erfüllen: das Leben von Menschen zu verbessern und zu verlängern, indem wir aus den Erfahrungen jedes einzelnen Krebspatienten lernen. Bist Du bereit, den Wandel in der Krebsbehandlung aktiv mitzugestalten?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flatiron Health ist ein Healthtech-Unternehmen, das mit Hilfe von Real World Daten (RWD) eine bessere Versorgung von Menschen mit Krebs auf der ganzen Welt ermöglicht. Flatiron arbeitet mit Krebsbehandlungszentren in den USA, Europa und Asien zusammen, um ein modernes, onkologisches Netzwerk zu schaffen und somit die Erfahrungen von einzelnen Patienten in hochqualitative Datensätze zu übersetzen. Wir arbeiten in multidisziplinären Teams mit Expert:innen aus den Bereichen Onkologie, Datenwissenschaft, Software, Epidemiologie, Produkt und vielen anderen mehr. Flatiron Health ist eine unabhängige Tochtergesellschaft der Roche-Gruppe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Die Tätigkeit ist 100% remote und kann flexibel von zu Hause in Deutschland aus erbracht werden – ob Du lieber früh morgens, nachmittags oder abends arbeitest, wir möchten Dich unterstützen, die für Dich passenden Arbeitszeiten zu finden, damit sich die Arbeit gut mit Deinem Studium vereinbaren lässt. Die Arbeitszeit kann abhängig von deiner individuellen Studiensituation flexibel gestaltet werden auf bis zu 20 oder 25 Stunden pro Woche.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du dokumentierst unstrukturierte onkologische Patientendaten aus klinischen Krankenhaus- und Arztpraxissystemen in unser eigens dafür entwickeltes Softwaresystem, einschließlich der komplexen Erfassung, Speicherung und Überprüfung von klinischen Diagnose-, Behandlungs- und Nachsorgedaten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bringst Dein onkologisches Fachwissen ein und erweiterst dies kontinuierlich, um eine detailgetreue und vollständige Dokumentation in einer Vielzahl von klinischen Projekten zu ermöglichen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du gibst direktes Feedback zu neuen Funktionen, Tools und Workflows und trägst damit zur inhaltlichen Weiterentwicklung und Qualitätssicherung unserer Softwarelösungen bei&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du unterstützt uns dabei, schriftliche Arbeitsanweisungen zur korrekten und einheitlichen Dokumentation stetig weiter zu entwickeln&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du evaluierst Ansätze zur Dokumentation neuer Datenelemente&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du bist eine engagierte, kooperative und zielorientierte Persönlichkeit, die Freude an der Entwicklung von Lösungen hat und offen für neue Perspektiven ist. Zudem bringst Du mit:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immatrikulation an einer medizinischen Fakultät in Deutschland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Abgeschlossenes vorklinisches Medizinstudium&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgeprägtes Interesse an Krebserkrankungen sowie an der Arbeit mit onkologischen Patientendaten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onkologisch-fachliche Vorerfahrung z.B. im Rahmen von Famulaturen, Praktika und anderen klinischen Tätigkeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wünschenswert Grundkenntnisse zu Histologie, Klassifizierungssystemen (TNM, ect) und Therapie onkologischer Erkrankungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Idealerweise Vorerfahrung im Umgang mit Tumordokumentationssystemen (TDS), Datenbanken und Software zur Krebsregistrierung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basis-IT-Kenntnisse (idealerweise Mac OS) und Offenheit für neue Softwarelösungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgeprägte Kommunikationsfähigkeit, Zuverlässigkeit, Liebe zum Detail, Integrationsfähigkeit sowie ein hohes Maß an Eigeninitiative und Selbstständigkeit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deutsch auf Muttersprachenniveau und gute Englischkenntnisse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;section data-ui=&quot;job-description&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section data-ui=&quot;job-requirements&quot;&gt;
&lt;section data-ui=&quot;job-description&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section data-ui=&quot;job-requirements&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MinIO is the data and memory foundation for enterprise AI. Built for the speed, scale, and economics that AI and analytics demand, AIStor and MemKV unify every layer of the data stack, from agentic and inference context memory to tables and objects across core, edge, and cloud. Trusted by 77% of the Fortune 100, MinIO is redefining how AI factories, intelligent applications, and autonomous agents secure, persist, and unlock the full value of their data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a technical, creative, and entrepreneurial Enterprise Account Executive to drive MinIO’s next stage of growth in the Germany region. This is a role for a proven seller who can combine technical depth in storage, data infrastructure, data lake/lakehouse, AI/ML, and HPC environments with the ability to close complex $250K+ enterprise deals. The ideal candidate has experience competing against legacy storage solutions, thrives in a startup environment, and brings a mix of creativity, persistence, and technical credibility to win transformative deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive New Business Acquisition&lt;/strong&gt;: Actively prospect and identify enterprise opportunities, leveraging your network and creative outreach to generate pipeline and close high-value deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Vision Selling&lt;/strong&gt;: Confidently articulate how MinIO delivers transformational outcomes for data infrastructure, AI/ML, and HPC not just incremental improvements. Translate technical capabilities into compelling business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close Complex Deals&lt;/strong&gt;: Own the full sales cycle from lead to close, with a focus on $250K+ opportunities and annual quota attainment of $1.5M+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compete &amp;amp; Win Against Legacy Software&lt;/strong&gt;: Position MinIO against traditional storage vendors by demonstrating the advantages of cloud-native, S3-compatible object storage for modern workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Educate &amp;amp; Influence&lt;/strong&gt;: Teach prospects about AI infrastructure optimization and data architecture modernization, leading them beyond product comparisons to strategic transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quantify Value&lt;/strong&gt;: Build business cases and ROI models that include quantified benefits, risk mitigation, and financial justification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner-First Territory Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: Build and execute partner-led co-selling strategies, working with channel and alliance partners to expand territory coverage and accelerate deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with Solutions Engineering, Product, and Marketing to deliver tailored solutions, ensure successful POCs, and create a seamless customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecasting &amp;amp; Planning&lt;/strong&gt;: Maintain disciplined pipeline management, accurate forecasting, and clear account strategies that support predictable and scalable revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Sales Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: 7+ years of enterprise sales experience with consistent quota attainment ($1.5M+) and average deal sizes of $250K+.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Acumen&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong knowledge of storage, data infrastructure, data lakehouse, AI/ML, and HPC environments. Able to engage technical stakeholders and translate technical concepts into business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner-Led Approach&lt;/strong&gt;: History of building co-selling strategies with channel and alliance partners to scale market presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vision &amp;amp; Thought Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: Skilled at leading transformation sales by shaping buyer thinking and providing unique customer insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Selling&lt;/strong&gt;: Proven ability to sell against legacy storage solutions and displace entrenched vendors with a differentiated value proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Startup Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: Demonstrated success in fast-paced, entrepreneurial environments where creativity and adaptability are essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenger Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;: Skilled at teaching, tailoring, and challenging customer perspectives to unlock new opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network &amp;amp; Territory Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Deep relationships within the territory, including decision makers and influencers who can be leveraged to accelerate business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Influence&lt;/strong&gt;: Exceptional presentation, negotiation, and relationship-building skills with both technical and executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;: BA/BS in computer science, engineering, business, or related field; MBA preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section data-ui=&quot;job-benefits&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section data-ui=&quot;job-benefits&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Policy (EEO)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;MinIO is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and an affirmative action employer. We review applications for employment without regard to their race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, veteran status, genetic information, physical or mental disability, medical condition, marital status, or any other basis prohibited by law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 4&quot;&gt;About&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 4&quot;&gt;Carbonfuture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Carbonfuture provides the trust infrastructure that helps organizations meet their net-zero commitments and gets climate action financed at scale. Our digital infrastructure makes carbon removal credits traceable, enforceable, and trustworthy, so suppliers, buyers, and financial institutions can transact with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we are the global market leader by facilitated carbon removal sales volume, working with some of the most ambitious companies in the market, including Microsoft, Swiss Re, and SAP. &amp;nbsp;We are backed by SIX, operator of the Swiss and Spanish stock exchanges, as a strategic investor and partner, and operate from our headquarters in Freiburg, Germany (Carbonfuture GmbH), where contracts are governed under German law. We also have subsidiaries in Switzerland and the US.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW140738050 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW140738050 BCX8&quot;&gt;Your Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our goal is to turn carbon credits into a new financial asset class and provide the settlement infrastructure. This requires governance frameworks for our digital infrastructure, standardised contracts for an evolving asset class and enforceable rules that financial institutions, regulators and customers can rely on, and Carbonfuture is writing many of them. The liability and risk landscape is largely unmapped: this is genuinely novel work where the legal groundwork you establish will set standards in an emerging industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our contracting parties span between project developers who are removing CO2 out of the atmosphere with frontier technologies as well as the biggest corporates worldwide (including SAP, Microsoft, Swiss Re) purchasing carbon credits from us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Legal Counsel to lead that work. You&#39;ll own our contracts from first draft to signature, act as our legal lead in fundraising, and shape the legal and governance framework behind our instruments. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to publish, represent Carbonfuture in trade associations, and help define standards for the asset class.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a senior, hands-on role with real ownership. You&#39;ll report to our COO, lead our in-house legal function including a part-time legal counsel, and own the legal budget.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Contracts &amp;amp; Negotiation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own the full contract lifecycle, from drafting and negotiation to signing, across customer, supplier, offtake and vendor agreements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Negotiate key deals together with leadership, bringing in external counsel where it adds value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Help build the standardised contract structure that replaces today&#39;s bespoke bilateral terms between suppliers and buyers and makes the markets scaleable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Carbon Credits as a new Financial Asset Class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Drive the legal workstream to establish carbon credits as an institutional asset class, from governance framework to documentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Advise on capital markets and regulatory questions as we work with institutional market participants, banks and supervisory authorities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Represent Carbonfuture in selected associations and help shape market standards through them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Fundraising &amp;amp; Corporate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Act as our internal legal lead in fundraising rounds and own the signing and closing process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manage shareholder matters and corporate governance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Select, brief and steer external law firms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Legal Operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Oversee internal compliance across data protection, employment law and corporate governance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own the legal budget, internal and external&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead and develop a part-time legal counsel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build templates, processes and playbooks so the wider team can handle routine legal questions independently&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;8+ years of legal experience, in-house, at a law firm, or ideally both&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in German contract and commercial law, with hands-on experience in B2B transactions and negotiation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in German corporate law (Gesellschaftsrecht), knowledge of capital markets law (Kapitalmarktrecht) is considered a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with financing rounds, M&amp;amp;A or comparable transactions, including signing and closing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience with European financial regulators such as BaFin, the ECB or FINMA is a strong advantage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A background in financial market infrastructure, banking, commodities or carbon markets is a plus; capital markets lawyers curious about climate are very welcome to apply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Fluent German and English, written and spoken, at a level that lets you negotiate and draft in both&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You turn complex legal questions into clear options for the board, investors and colleagues who aren&#39;t lawyers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Sound commercial judgement: you calibrate risk to what&#39;s at stake and know when good enough is good enough&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Confident negotiator who builds trust with counterparties, shareholders and external counsel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Self-directed: you spot problems early and solve them without waiting to be asked&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The chance to shape the legal foundations of a new asset class at a company already leading its market&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A rapidly growing international team with a shared mission to address climate change&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours and location. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;30 days paid leave + bank holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Sports and Health benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Purpose-driven, ambitious colleagues and a friendly, open and inclusive environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Carbonfuture is an international hybrid and remote office environment with team members located in the EU, US and Latin America. Our main offices are located in Freiburg, Berlin, Zurich and San Francisco. Candidates should be prepared to either work from home or in one of our hubs. This position requires the ability to work core hours Monday through Friday with availability for European time zone meetings and events. This position will require occasional early morning or evening work and some in-person attendance for all-staff or department-level events which will require overnight travel. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Candidates from cultures and backgrounds underrepresented in VC-backed startups and the climate space are strongly encouraged to apply. A diverse and inclusive workplace where we learn from each other is an integral part of our culture. We actively welcome people of different backgrounds, experiences, abilities, and perspectives. We are an equal-opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

Crytek is looking for an experienced Development Director to lead delivery on&nbsp;a game development project&nbsp;in our Frankfurt office.


Reporting to the COO,&nbsp;you will&nbsp;own&nbsp;end-to-end project delivery and the operational model of the&nbsp;project.&nbsp;You will&nbsp;be responsible&nbsp;for&nbsp;ensuring the team is structured, staffed, and run effectively to deliver on time, within budget, and at the required quality level.&nbsp;


You will balance&nbsp;the production plan against&nbsp;creative ambition, technical constraints, and business priorities, working with your peers in the leadership team,&nbsp;and define&nbsp;how the team&nbsp;operates: decision-making and ways of working to drive clarity, accountability, and consistent execution at scale.&nbsp;

Responsibilities 


Define and evolve the project’s operational model, including team structures, roles, processes, and pipelines, to ensure alignment with studio goals and&nbsp;optimal&nbsp;performance
Build, lead, and scale a high-performing development team, ensuring clear ownership, proper staffing, and empowerment across all areas of responsibility
End-to-end delivery performance by proactively identifying risks and obstacles, driving mitigation, and ensuring on-time, on-budget, high-quality outcome
Project planning and execution, including roadmap, PBS/WBS, scheduling, and milestone alignment, with a strong focus on player value and business objective
Stakeholder management, including budgeting, team allocation, external partner integration, and alignment on quality expectations (e.g. UX, performance, live ops)
Retrospectives to continuously improve team effectiveness, strengthening cross-functional collaboration, and fostering a culture of accountability and performance


Requirements 


10+ years leading large-scale game development with full delivery accountability (time, budget, quality), including shipping at least one impactful title from inception to release
Deep expertise in building and operating effective development models (team structures, resource &amp; budget planning, governance, execution), beyond applying standard frameworks (Agile, SAFe, etc.)
Strong leadership capability with a clear history of building, aligning, and holding teams accountable, while improving performance through structures, processes, and ways of working
Excellent stakeholder and leadership management skills, with the ability to create alignment and facilitate decisions at senior and executive levels
Proven ability to integrate and manage external partners, operate effectively within a Core Leadership Team, and deliver outcomes with strong ownership and execution focus
Willingness to relocate to Frankfurt, Germany&nbsp;



What you can expect from us
Career Path&nbsp;
Your professional development is important to us, so we have laid out a career plan to help you progress towards your goals and objectives.&nbsp;
&nbsp;
Relocation&nbsp;Support&nbsp;
We offer a relocation budget and full coverage of flights to Frankfurt for you and your family.&nbsp;
You can expect extensive assistance with visa, work permits, and communication with authorities during the relocation process, as well as help settling into Germany (e.g. setting up appointments with banks, government agencies, schools, landlords, finding apartments etc.).
&nbsp;
Company Apartment&nbsp;
To help you get settled, we provide you with a fully furnished company apartment during your first three months in Frankfurt.
&nbsp;
Public Transport Pass&nbsp;
Discover Frankfurt by bus, tram and metro – free of charge.
&nbsp;
Gym Card&nbsp;
A healthy body is a healthy mind. We offer a membership at the premium gym chain Fitness First in Germany. Work out, join group fitness classes, or relax in the wellness facilities.
&nbsp;
State-of-the-art Office
We’ve recently moved into a brand-new, modern office located in the heart of Frankfurt. Our new workspace is designed to inspire creativity and collaboration, with open areas, quiet zones, and top-tier facilities — all just steps away from public transport, restaurants, bars and cultural hotspots.
&nbsp;
Hybrid WorkingWe believe in the value of in-person collaboration while also supporting flexibility. Our hybrid working model includes three days per week in the office and the option to work remotely up to two days per week, unless role-specific requirements or business needs require you to be on site.
&nbsp;
Equal Opportunity &amp; Inclusion
We’re building a workplace where everyone belongs. We welcome people of all backgrounds and identities and are proud to be a truly global team, with employees from over 42 countries contributing their ideas, cultures, and perspectives every day.
&nbsp;
German Classes&nbsp;
Understanding the local culture will make your stay abroad more enjoyable, and Crytek supports that by offering German language courses for you and your family.&nbsp;
&nbsp;&nbsp;
Events
Join us on our exciting company events, including new starter breakfasts, summer and winter parties, our annual trip to Gamescom in Cologne, and many more!
&nbsp;
Vacation Days&nbsp;
At our Frankfurt office you can enjoy 24 days of vacation per year, and every 2 years you get 1 more (up to a maximum of 28 days). You will also have on average 10 public holidays on top of the days you take off.&nbsp;
