&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong data-driven mindset with a solid understanding of digital tools, analytics, and performance measurement frameworks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
